  "body": "## Summary\n\nRetain four measured Pump Main source/layout improvements:\n\n- correct exact-SOL quote-guard placement while preserving the two-slot residual\n- align sweep fee zeroing, native/token transfer sequencing, and recipient handling\n- improve admin CTO account borrows, holder payout construction, and CPI program evaluation order\n- share one Clock timestamp across multi-hop event constructors\n\nThese changes reduce targeted bytecode differences but do **not** claim whole-function or whole-ELF completion.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Fresh clean native build: runtime-valid, no stack warnings\n- Full census preserved exactly: **1,019/1,035 normalized, 188 raw, 16 unmatched**\n- Stripped SHA-256: `49fa618396d96ead75cad63d8bb56dcd173b856383d5f65e8f7cdfc0fa3a42ba`\n- Unstripped SHA-256: `04fdafc05f29ef47cfa8f3d03597499b8c47909ad2e04dc74524071ba10f4e93`\n- Signed differential validation: **1,198 cases, 2,723 executions, 3,503 verified signature fields, zero mismatches**\n- `git diff --check`: clean\n\n## Remaining work\n\nAll 16 masked Pump Main residuals remain unmatched, including the two swapped result-word loads in legacy `buy_exact_sol_in`. Whole meaningful ELF equality remains open. AMM source is untouched.\n",
